.env
# Machine-local NebulonMind overrides (same INI shape as nebulonmd.cfg,
# only the keys this machine changed). The tracked nebulonmd.cfg ships
# defaults; per-machine edits belong here so `git status` stays clean.
nebulonmd.local.cfg

